\ Locals earn their keep here: three live values, `a` reused and reordered.
\ Point-free this would be a dup/over/rot knot; named, it reads like the formula.
: lerp ( int int int -- int )   \ a + (b - a) * t  (integer affine combo)
  | a b t | b a - t * a + ;

: main ( -- )
  0 10 3 lerp . ;    \ prints 30
